    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "서비스 상태판 · 운영(dev) · 최근 5분",
      "description": "줄을 누르면 그 서비스가 선택된 서비스 상태 화면이 열립니다.\n수집 상태: 정상이 아니면 서비스 상태의 '서비스 수집 상태'와 Pod 재시작 여부 확인\n5xx 비율: 오르면 같은 서비스의 오류 로그 확인 (Gateway는 하위 서비스 오류를 포함)\n초당 요청: 갑자기 0이 되면 Gateway 라우팅 · 앞단 서비스 확인, 급증하면 오류율 · 응답시간 함께 확인\n평균 응답시간: 오르면 서비스 상태의 DB 연결 대기 · GC 확인 (p95 아님)\n마지막 재시작: 예상하지 못한 최근 시각이면 배포 이력 · 수동 패치(#1349) 덮어쓰기 · 메모리 부족 확인",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 12
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max by (job) (((max by (env, job) (last_over_time(up{env=\"dev\",job=~\"kidly-gateway|kidly-member|kidly-product|kidly-order|kidly-payment|kidly-settlement|kidly-search|kidly-recommend|kidly-notification|kidly-community\"}[1m])) + 1) and on(env,job) (label_replace(max by (env, app_job) (kidly_app_expected{env=\"dev\",app_job=~\"kidly-gateway|kidly-member|kidly-product|kidly-order|kidly-payment|kidly-settlement|kidly-search|kidly-recommend|kidly-notification|kidly-community\"}), \"job\", \"$1\", \"app_job\", \"(.+)\") == 1)) or on(env,job) ((label_replace(max by (env, app_job) (kidly_app_expected{env=\"dev\",app_job=~\"kidly-gateway|kidly-member|kidly-product|kidly-order|kidly-payment|kidly-settlement|kidly-search|kidly-recommend|kidly-notification|kidly-community\"}), \"job\", \"$1\", \"app_job\", \"(.+)\") == 1) * 0) or on(env,job) ((label_replace(max by (env, app_job) (kidly_app_expected{env=\"dev\",app_job=~\"kidly-gateway|kidly-member|kidly-product|kidly-order|kidly-payment|kidly-settlement|kidly-search|kidly-recommend|kidly-notification|kidly-community\"}), \"job\", \"$1\", \"app_job\", \"(.+)\") == 0) * 0 - 1))",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "(sum by (job) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{env=\"dev\",job=~\"kidly-gateway|kidly-member|kidly-product|kidly-order|kidly-payment|kidly-settlement|kidly-search|kidly-recommend|kidly-notification|kidly-community\",uri!~\"/actuator.*\",status=~\"5..\"}[5m])) or sum by (job) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{env=\"dev\",job=~\"kidly-gateway|kidly-member|kidly-product|kidly-order|kidly-payment|kidly-settlement|kidly-search|kidly-recommend|kidly-notification|kidly-community\",uri!~\"/actuator.*\"}[5m])) * 0) / (sum by (job) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{env=\"dev\",job=~\"kidly-gateway|kidly-member|kidly-product|kidly-order|kidly-payment|kidly-settlement|kidly-search|kidly-recommend|kidly-notification|kidly-community\",uri!~\"/actuator.*\"}[5m])) > 0)",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "sum by (job) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{env=\"dev\",job=~\"kidly-gateway|kidly-member|kidly-product|kidly-order|kidly-payment|kidly-settlement|kidly-search|kidly-recommend|kidly-notification|kidly-community\",uri!~\"/actuator.*\"}[5m]))",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "D",
          "expr": "sum by (job) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_sum{env=\"dev\",job=~\"kidly-gateway|kidly-member|kidly-product|kidly-order|kidly-payment|kidly-settlement|kidly-search|kidly-recommend|kidly-notification|kidly-community\",uri!~\"/actuator.*\"}[5m])) / (sum by (job) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{env=\"dev\",job=~\"kidly-gateway|kidly-member|kidly-product|kidly-order|kidly-payment|kidly-settlement|kidly-search|kidly-recommend|kidly-notification|kidly-community\",uri!~\"/actuator.*\"}[5m])) > 0)",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "E",
          "expr": "max by (job) (process_start_time_seconds{env=\"dev\",job=~\"kidly-gateway|kidly-member|kidly-product|kidly-order|kidly-payment|kidly-settlement|kidly-search|kidly-recommend|kidly-notification|kidly-community\"}) * 1000",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}"
        }
      ],
